{% comment %}
  InstaMom University — the short allergen warning, shown immediately above the
  Checkout button.

  The owner's copy is headed "Short description for checkout". Shopify's actual
  checkout pages are not themable on this plan (checkout.liquid is Plus-only),
  so the last surface we control before the shopper leaves for Shopify's
  checkout is the cart. This renders in BOTH cart surfaces — the cart page
  (sections/main-cart-footer.liquid) and the cart drawer
  (snippets/cart-drawer.liquid) — so it can't be skipped by whichever route the
  shopper takes.

  If a checkout-page notice is wanted as well, that is a store setting, not a
  theme change: Settings → Checkout → "Additional scripts" / the checkout
  editor's custom content block.

  Wording is the owner's, verbatim; the full disclaimer it links to is
  pages/allergen-disclaimer (source: shopify/content/allergen-disclaimer.html).

  Styling: .instamom-allergen-notice* in assets/instamom.css
{% endcomment %}

<div class="instamom-allergen-notice">
  <p class="instamom-allergen-notice__body">
    <strong>ALLERGEN WARNING:</strong> Care packages may contain or come into
    contact with major food allergens. InstaMom University is not an
    allergen-free business and cannot guarantee that any product is free from
    allergens or cross-contact. The purchaser and recipient are responsible for
    reviewing every manufacturer label before consumption.
    <strong>
      To the fullest extent permitted by law, InstaMom University is not
      responsible for allergic reactions, sensitivities, illness, or injury
      resulting from consuming included food products.
    </strong>
  </p>
  <a class="instamom-allergen-notice__link" href="{{ pages['allergen-disclaimer'].url | default: '/pages/allergen-disclaimer' }}">
    Read the full allergen &amp; dietary restriction disclaimer
  </a>
</div>
